ect from planning to completion. Responsible for budget control, schedule management, and quality assurance. Collaborated closely with architects, engineers, and subcontractors.\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"skills\": [\n        \"Project Planning\",\n        \"Risk Management\",\n        \"Agile Methodologies\",\n        \"Budgeting\",\n        \"Stakeholder Communication\",\n        \"Team Leadership\"\n    ],\n    \"certifications\": [\n        \"PMP\",\n        \"Agile Certified Practitioner\"\n    ],\n    \"objective\": \"Seeking a challenging project management role where I can leverage my experience and skills to deliver successful projects.\",\n    \"languages\": [\n        \"English\"\n    ],\n    \"portfolio_links\": [],\n    \"availability\": \"2024-03-15\"\n}"}
